ge_path=/images/2026/10/9/Mine-Tour.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 07:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59513</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Fall on the Road to Old Dominion</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/9/mens-soccer-mountaineers-fall-on-the-road-to-old-dominion</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/9/mens-soccer-mountaineers-fall-on-the-road-to-old-dominion</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Aurelien Cormier dribbles the ball for WVU Men's Soccer" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/9/MSOC_WVUvsGeorgiaState_Sept18_2026_TT_164_large.jpg" /><br /><br />NORFOLK, Va. – The No. 15 West Virginia University men's soccer team suffered a 2-1 defeat at the hands of Old Dominion, Friday night at the ODU Soccer Complex. The Mountaineers suffer their first loss since the season opener and fall to 5-2-3 overall and 1-1-2 in the Sun Belt while the Monarchs improve to 9-3-0 and 1-3-0 in conference play.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/MSOC_WVUvsGeorgiaState_Sept18_2026_TT_164_large.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/MSOC_WVUvsGeorgiaState_Sept18_2026_TT_164_large.jpg"><media:title>Aurelien Cormier dribbles the ball for WVU Men's Soccer</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/MSOC_WVUvsGeorgiaState_Sept18_2026_TT_164_large.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Fri, 9 Oct 2026 21:56:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59516</s:story_id></item><item><title>No. 9 West Virginia Wins Nuttycombe Invitational</title><link>h