_vsHouston_Oct4_2026_AM_088.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University volleyball team (9-6, 2-3 Big 12) have another ranked opponent on its hands in No. 17 BYU at 8:30 p.m. ET at George Albert Smith Fieldhouse in Provo, Utah.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/VB_vsHouston_Oct4_2026_AM_088.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/VB_vsHouston_Oct4_2026_AM_088.jpg"><media:title>WVU huddles before the match against Houston on Oct. 4 inside Hope Coliseum</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/VB_vsHouston_Oct4_2026_AM_088.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Fri, 9 Oct 2026 12:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>17</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59512</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Release 2027 Baseball Schedule</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/9/mountaineers-release-2027-baseball-schedule</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/9/mountaineers-release-2027-baseball-schedule</guid><category>Baseball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Kendrick Family Ballpark overhead picture" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/9/053126_BSB_WakeForest_NCAAT_GB_131_large.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University Department of Intercollegiate Athletics has announced the 2027 Mountaineer Baseball schedule.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/053126_BSB_WakeForest_NCAAT_GB_131_large.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_pri